 begin="03:13.807" end="03:14.370">boku</span><span begin="03:14.370" end="03:14.753">ra</span><span begin="03:14.753" end="03:15.078">wa</span></text></transliteration></transliterations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="03:31.912"><div begin="00:01.029" end="03:18.666"><p begin="00:01.029" end="00:03.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:01.029" end="00:01.784">もう</span><span begin="00:01.784" end="00:02.477">いい</span><span begin="00:02.477" end="00:02.927">か</span><span begin="00:02.927" end="00:03.538">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经足够了吗 已经足够了</span></p><p begin="00:03.764" end="00:06.350" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:03.764" end="00:04.559">もう</span><span begin="00:04.559" end="00:05.315">いい</span><span begin="00:05.315" end="00:06.350">よ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经足够了</span></p><p begin="00:06.483" end="00:08.626" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3"><span begin="00:06.483" end="00:07.226">見えてる</span><span begin="00:07.226" end="00:08.048">ものだけじゃ</span><span begin="00:08.048" end="00:08.268">ほ</span><span begin="00:08.268" end="00:08.626">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仅仅着眼于浮于表面的浅显之处</span></p><p begin="00:08.636" end="00:12.230" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4"><span begin="00:08.636" end="00:09.016">理</span><span begin="00:09.016" end="00:09.474">解で</span><span begin="00:09.474" end="00:09.938">き</span><span begin="00:09.938" end="00:10.289">な</span><span begin="00:10.289" end="00:10.635">い</span><span begin="00:10.635" end="00:11.622">心</span><span begin="00:11.622" end="00:12.230">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本无法理解这颗心</span></p><p begin="00:12.239" end="00:14.662" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5"><span begin="00:12.239" end="00:13.043">もう</span><span begin="00:13.043" end="00:13.828">いい</span><span begin="00:13.828" end="00:14.662">かい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">已经足够了吗 还是重新来过</span></p><p begin="00:15.118" end="00:17.463" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6"><span begin="00:15.118" end="00:15.873">もう</span><span begin="00:15.873" end="00:16.475">一</span><span begin="00:16.475" end="00:17.463">回</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再来一次</span></p><p begin="00:17.705" end="00:23.869" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7"><span begin="00:17.705" end="00:18.624">選べない</span><span begin="00:18.624" end="00:19.739">未来ならば</span><span begin="00:19.848" end="00:20.799">僕らが</span><span begin="00:20.799" end="00:22.063">選ぶは</span><span begin="00:22.063" end="00:22.872">なん</span><span begin="00:22.872" end="00:23.869">だ？</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">倘若未来无法自由抉择</span></p><p begin="00:40.592" end="00:43.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8"><span begin="00:40.592" end="00:41.252">感</span><span begin="00:41.252" end="00:41.856">情</span><span begin="00:41.856" end="00:43.135">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感情也好 妄想也罢</span></p><p begin="00:43.430" end="00:45.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9"><span begin="00:43.430" end="00:44.062">妄</span><span begin="00:44.062" end="00:44.764">想</span><span begin="00:44.764" end="00:45.791">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是妄想</span></p><p begin="00:46.068" end="00:48.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10"><span begin="00:46.068" end="00:46.621">もはや</span><span begin="00:46.621" end="00:47.101">意味を</span><span begin="00:47.101" end="00:47.752">なさない</span><span begin="00:47.752" end="00:48.157">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">时至今日 已然失去任何意义</span></p><p begin="00:48.167" end="00:51.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11"><span begin="00:48.167" end="00:48.704">崩</span><span begin="00:48.704" end="00:49.103">れた</span><span begin="00:49.103" end="00:49.637">街</span><span begin="00:49.637" end="00:50.041">が</span><span begin="00:50.041" end="00:50.464">に</span><span begin="00:50.464" end="00:50.998">や</span><span begin="00:50.998" end="00:51.230">つ</span><span begin="00:51.230" end="00:51.754">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一片涂炭的街道 犹如投来嘲讽狞笑</span></p><p begin="00:52.238" end="00:55.195" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12"><span begin="00:52.238" end="00:52.620">確</span><span begin="00:52.620" end="00:52.942">か</span><span begin="00:52.942" end="00:53.257">な</span><span begin="00:53.257" end="00:53.843">もの</span><span begin="00:53.843" end="00:54.250">な</span><span begin="00:54.250" end="00:54.637">んて</span><span begin="00:54.637" end="00:54.903">な</span><span begin="00:54.903" end="00:55.195">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">根本不存在确切真实之物</span></p><p begin="00:55.214" end="00:57.696" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="00:55.214" end="00:56.105">わかるはず</span><span begin="00:56.105" end="00:56.463">が</span><span begin="00:56.463" end="00:56.814">ない</span><span begin="00:56.814" end="00:57.065">の</span><span begin="00:57.065" end="00:57.696">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">明明我们原本不应懂得</span></p><p begin="00:57.745" end="01:02.553" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="00:57.745" end="00:58.223">それ</span><span begin="00:58.223" end="00:58.567">で</span><span begin="00:58.567" end="00:58.941">も</span><span begin="00:58.977" end="00:59.280">確</span><span begin="00:59.442" end="00:59.802">かめ</span><span begin="00:59.964" end="01:00.237">た</span><span begin="01:00.395" end="01:00.686">い</span><span begin="01:01.001" end="01:01.383">の</span><span begin="01:01.383" end="01:01.794">だか</span><span begin="01:01.794" end="01:02.553">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为即便如此 仍然渴望究明事实</span></p><p begin="01:02.943" end="01:05.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:02.943" end="01:03.157">見</span><span begin="01:03.157" end="01:03.481">せ</span><span begin="01:03.481" end="01:03.885">たく</span><span begin="01:03.885" end="01:04.357">ない</span><span begin="01:04.357" end="01:04.812">も